  "description": "**We are currently offering framesets only. No ability for complete bicycle builds.**\n\nNEW 700/650b Frameset (Tire Clearance up to 48c)\nCurrent turn-around for a frameset is 8-10 weeks until shipment. This could be extended depending on options chosen. Please ask.\n\nFEATURES AND INFORMATION\nDesigned And Developed By Milwaukee Bicycle Co. - Handmade By the old Waterford Precision Cycles*\n\nTUBING\nThe Milwaukee Mettle is built featuring complete Vari-wall THERMLX main & rear end. With oversized top and down tube for confident cornering.\nThe geometry on this frame is designed to be the best cyclocross bike you could ride. Off-camber hills and tight corners become minor obstacles as your storm your way to the finish line\n\nTIRE CLEARANCE\nClearance for 700/650b 48c Tires.\n\nBRAKE CABLE ROUTING\nDown Tube Underside Zip Tie Brake Cable Routing.\n\nSTOCK DERAILLEUR ROUTING\nFront/Rear Derailleur Cable Stops Stock(If you are ordering a frameset only let us know in the order comments if you are running 1x11 and we'll remove the unused cable stop).\n\nBRAZE-ONS\nSeat Tube and Down Tube Water Bottle Bosses\nDisc Brake Down Tube Cable Guides\nFront and Rear Derailleur Cable Stops\nFlat Mount Disc Brake Only\nStainless Steel Milwaukee Headbadge, Milwaukee Script And WI State Badges",
